Package: openai-codex-cli
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: coplo <dayearnew@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/openai/codex
Depends: bubblewrap
Recommends: ripgrep
Description: OpenAI Codex command-line coding agent
 Codex CLI is OpenAI's local command-line coding agent. This package installs
 the official standalone Linux release and uses APT as the software update
 mechanism while leaving per-user Codex configuration and state untouched.
